        "id": 218176,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-22T21:35:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have a print run of Spirit Island on a train in New Mexico (as of this morning). It'll be out to stores around Origins I'd guess, based on my past experience with the distributor/retailer supply chain. It is entirely sold out to distibutors, so if you see it in stores this summer, pick it up right away!</p><p>There is *another* print run that is about to leave China. I'd guess that it is likely to be in stores around Labor Day, and it is *also* nearly sold out to distributors (even though it is bigger than the closer print run).</p><p>We're anticipating having yet another print run in stores for Thanksgiving / end of year holidays.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:50:14.348Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
